#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:222 crates/monet/src/main.rs:313
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Choose Windows in the app menu to finish setting it up."
msgstr "尚未安裝 Windows。請在 App 選單中選擇「Windows」完成設定。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:224
msgid ""
"Windows is encrypted with BitLocker, so Monet can't set it up for you. In Windows, open Monet for Windows and run Install Monet."
msgstr ""
"Windows 已使用 BitLocker 加密，所以 Monet 無法替您設定。請在 Windows 中開啟「Monet for Windows」並執行「Install Monet」。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:229
msgid ""
"Windows is asleep, so Monet can't set it up yet. Open Windows, choose Restart, and Monet finishes the rest."
msgstr "Windows 正在睡眠，所以 Monet 還無法設定它。請開啟 Windows，選擇「重新啟動」，Monet 就會完成剩下的工作。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:237
msgid "This PC didn't start in UEFI mode, so Monet can't switch to Windows."
msgstr "這台電腦不是以 UEFI 模式啟動，所以 Monet 無法切換到 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:244 crates/monet/src/main.rs:533
msgid ""
"Windows wasn't found on this PC. Install Windows first, then try again."
msgstr "在這台電腦上找不到 Windows。請先安裝 Windows，然後再試一次。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:264
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "未找到"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:266
msgid "Unavailable (not a UEFI system)"
msgstr "無法使用（非 UEFI 系統）"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:323
msgid "Play %1 on Windows?"
msgstr "要在 Windows 上玩 %1 嗎？"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:324
msgid "Play on Windows?"
msgstr "要在 Windows 上玩嗎？"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:330
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and start the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
msgstr "電腦會重新啟動進入 Windows 並開始遊戲。結束遊戲後，就會回到 Monet。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:331
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows with your game launchers ready to sign in to. Open apps will close."
msgstr "電腦會重新啟動進入 Windows，並備妥遊戲啟動器讓您登入。開啟中的 App 將會關閉。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:332
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows, update it and your games, and switch off when they're done. Open apps will close."
msgstr "電腦會重新啟動進入 Windows，更新 Windows 和您的遊戲，完成後關機。開啟中的 App 將會關閉。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:333
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows. Open apps will close."
msgstr "電腦會重新啟動進入 Windows。開啟中的 App 將會關閉。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:537
msgid ""
"Monet seems to have started from the Windows entry, which shouldn't happen."
msgstr "Monet 似乎是從 Windows 的開機項目啟動的，這種情況不應該發生。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:569
msgid ""
"This PC's firmware didn't keep the switch to Windows. Restart and choose Windows in the PC's boot menu."
msgstr "這台電腦的韌體沒有保留切換到 Windows 的設定。請重新啟動，並在電腦的開機選單中選擇 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:601
msgid "The restart was blocked. Restart your PC to continue in Windows."
msgstr "重新啟動被阻擋了。請重新啟動電腦，以繼續進入 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:689
msgid "This copy of Monet can't install Windows by itself."
msgstr "這個版本的 Monet 無法自行安裝 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:711
msgid "Getting Windows ready for your games"
msgstr "正在為您的遊戲準備 Windows"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:713
msgid ""
"Monet is downloading Windows (about 7 GB). You can keep using your PC; Monet asks before it restarts."
msgstr "Monet 正在下載 Windows（約 7 GB）。您可以繼續使用電腦；重新啟動前，Monet 會先詢問您。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:729
msgid ""
"Monet can install Windows from %1. Your PC restarts and Windows installs itself."
msgstr "Monet 可以用 %1 安裝 Windows。電腦會重新啟動，然後 Windows 會自行安裝。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:732
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Monet downloads it from Microsoft (about 7 GB) and installs it. This takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr "尚未安裝 Windows。Monet 會從 Microsoft 下載（約 7 GB）並安裝，大約需要 30 分鐘。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:736
msgid "Set up Windows?"
msgstr "要設定 Windows 嗎？"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:736
msgid "Set Up"
msgstr "設定"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:760
msgid ""
"Restart now to install Windows? It takes about 10 minutes, then you're back in Monet."
msgstr "要立即重新啟動並安裝 Windows 嗎？大約需要 10 分鐘，完成後就會回到 Monet。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:768
msgid ""
"Microsoft didn't allow the automatic download. Download Windows 11 from Microsoft's page (choose \"Download Windows 11 Disk Image (ISO)\"), keep it in Downloads, then choose Windows again."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 不允許自動下載。請從 Microsoft 的網頁下載 Windows 11（選擇「下載適用於 x64 裝置的 Windows 11 磁碟映像 (ISO)」），將檔案放在「下載」資料夾中，然後再選擇一次「Windows」。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:770
msgid "Download Windows"
msgstr "下載 Windows"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:770
msgid "Open Microsoft's Page"
msgstr "開啟 Microsoft 網頁"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:778
msgid "there isn't enough free space for Windows"
msgstr "沒有足夠的可用空間安裝 Windows"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:779
msgid ""
"Windows needs about 72 GB of the disk to itself, and 16 GB free in Monet while it downloads."
msgstr "Windows 需要約 72 GB 的專屬磁碟空間，下載期間 Monet 也需要保留 16 GB 的可用空間。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:784
msgid ""
"Windows couldn't be set up this time. Choose Windows in the app menu to try again."
msgstr "這次無法設定 Windows。請在 App 選單中選擇「Windows」再試一次。"

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:252
msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC skipped Monet's one-time start. Next time, Monet asks it a different way."
msgstr "Windows 沒有啟動：這台電腦略過了 Monet 設定的單次啟動。下次 Monet 會換個方式要求。"

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:262
msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC couldn't open its boot entry. Next time, Monet uses another one."
msgstr "Windows 沒有啟動：這台電腦無法開啟它的開機項目。下次 Monet 會改用另一個。"

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:264
msgid ""
"Windows didn't finish starting. Choose Play again to continue. If it happens again, open Settings, then Play on Windows, and choose Check."
msgstr "Windows 未能完成啟動。再選一次「開始」即可繼續。如果再次發生，請開啟「設定」，然後進入「在 Windows 上玩」，選擇「檢查」。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:128
msgid ""
"Writing to the USB stick failed. Try another USB port or another stick."
msgstr "寫入 USB 隨身碟失敗。請換一個 USB 連接埠，或換一支隨身碟。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:169
msgid ""
"Windows didn't let Monet write to the USB stick. Take it out, put it back in, and try again."
msgstr "Windows 不允許 Monet 寫入 USB 隨身碟。請拔出後重新插入，再試一次。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:206
msgid "The USB stick didn't keep what was written. Try another stick."
